    {
      "id": "D2",
      "term": "adhesome siRNA screen",
      "kind": "method",
      "definition": "Knockdown of 569 adhesion-related genes with Dharmacon SMARTpool siRNAs (four siRNAs per gene, 50 nM, DharmaFECT 4), followed by a nocodazole wash-out focal adhesion assay imaged by automated confocal microscopy; duplicate wells, 5-8 images per well."
    },
    {
