      "term": "focal adhesion size",
      "kind": "variable",
      "definition": "Area of focal adhesions stained for phospho-Tyr118 paxillin or vinculin, segmented from confocal images; distributions compared with the mock-transfected control by a two-sample Kolmogorov-Smirnov test."
    },
    {
